# Object Property: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000006> (has boundary determined by)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000006> "has boundary determined by"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000006> "tem limite determinado por"@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000006> "A relation between a functional location and a material entity such that the material entity provides the reference frame that determines the spatial boundaries of the functional location."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000006> "Uma relação entre um local de instalação e uma entidade material tal que a entidade material fornece o referencial que determina os limites espaciais do local de instalação."@pt-br)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000006> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000003>)
ObjectPropertyRange(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000006> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040>)

# Object Property: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> (identifies)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> "identifica"@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> "identifies"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> "A relation between a functional location code and a functional location such that the code uniquely denotes the functional location within the organizational hierarchy following the ISO 14224 coding scheme."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> "Uma relação entre um código de local de instalação e um local de instalação tal que o código denota unicamente o local de instalação dentro da hierarquia organizacional seguindo o esquema de codificação ISO 14224."@pt-br)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000219>)
FunctionalObjectProperty(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000004>)
ObjectPropertyRange(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000014> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000003>)

# Object Property: <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> (instalado em)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> "instalado em"@pt-br)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> "installed at"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> "A relation between a piece of equipment and a functional location such that the equipment is physically installed at the functional location during some temporally bounded period. The temporal bounds are captured via installedDate and removedDate data properties."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/annotation/naturalLanguageDefinition> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> "Uma relação entre uma peça de equipamento e um local de instalação tal que o equipamento está fisicamente instalado no local de instalação durante algum período temporalmente delimitado. Os limites temporais são capturados pelas propriedades de dados installedDate e removedDate."@pt-br)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000171>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/MaterialArtifact>)
ObjectPropertyRange(<https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000017> <https://www.inf.ufrgs.br/ontologies/ofl/OFL_0000003>)



